<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - MGM Grand started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Ladenburg Thalmann said it initiated coverage of MGM Grand Inc with a long-term buy rating, setting a 12-to-18-month price target of $45 on the stock.</p>
<p>-- The shares closed Tuesday at 39-1/2.</p>
</text>
